<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has taken leadership of a rebel coalition that includes the M23 movement and is attacking Congolese government forces in eastern DRC, with rebels seizing positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting. The United States has imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama for supplying the rebels, and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. Ebola workers are confronting an outbreak that has exceeded 5,000 deaths, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/2/us-to-suspend-south-africa-and-rwanda-from-duty-free-trade-access?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/us-to-drop-south-africa-rwanda-from-duty-free-trade-initiative/a-79834508?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/fae48a2f-7fb1-4b49-a261-0449fc335427?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j346xg0mkvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9lWUlWZ29nYmstUnhiaXhNeHFGYmRGbXJZV1JKc3BBMVdvTGlWcFdxRUNpQkR2RTJFSUtmdDdWNzF1RTJrM1VGRVBZOWZJM3c5UWlmMWRVdnBOVjc4d1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQdHpSLTAyWEtSRnNQOF85SExVTXNEaFJNVk1yMWNaZmZDNFQ1N2QwMFgtdTJJc0lPUTZmUUtvRWQyVERzMVNLdnBRWFNuZGRMa3dWQVhzQ2JWeW1Zc0ZJclZFdnBpZW82ZjNVaDVFWkxFOTV5Q0Jocm5QdGd5aU9FbC1ZTFNCNlY0R3RFZkg2czBnY2k3WnNHSTRsTWdYa296ZTVV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/